~ start
Player: (I don't think they want that.)
=> END

~ AIda_item_hospital_toilet_paper
aiDA: Thanks!
do Inventory.remove_item("hospital_toilet_paper")
do NotificationManager.add_notification("Toilet paper given to AIda.")
=> END

~ sergey_item_techpass

Sergey: Devushka, I don't think you want to give this back to me just yet.
Player: (He's right.)
Player: (What am I thinking?)
=> END

~ sergey_item_hospital_toilet_paper
Sergey: Oh. Toilet paper.
Sergey: Ummm... Thanks?
do Inventory.remove_item("hospital_toilet_paper")
do NotificationManager.add_notification("Toilet paper given to Sergey.")
Player: (Hmmm. Maybe this wasn't the most thoughtful gift.)
=> END

